# Patch 001: Remove Static Runtime Loader
Files Changed:
- index.html
- experience/public/index.html

Reason:
Static embedded HTML loading cards ("JUMO UEOS Runtime Initializing...") persisted on screen if React mount took time or if static assets loaded out of order.

Architectural Impact:
HTML files now serve as pure DOM mounting points (<div id="root"></div>). React components and UEOS Workspace Shell handle all runtime initialization, loading states, and error boundaries cleanly.

Rollback Information:
Re-insert static loading HTML card inside <div id="root"></div> in index.html and experience/public/index.html.
